    "detailed_description": "You're a duck. \ud83e\udd86 You have a pond.\ud83d\udca7 Life is great. \u2728<br>Except nosy visitors keep trying to come over to look at your pond and pet you! <br><br>Over your fallen feathers!<br><br>Territorial Duck is a cute 2D rogue-lite where you play as duck with sharing-difficulties.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/extras/ffa8f979fab75f18711a42d78f3e28da.avif?t=1723375564\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chase away visitors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Strike terror</strong> into the hearts of any who would dare step close to your pond. <br></li><li><strong>Steal items</strong> to make your quacks more fearsome to any who visit.<br></li><li><strong>Create wild builds</strong> by carefully choosing which items to steal.<br></li><li><strong>Keep your sanity</strong> until you've chased away each person and animal.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/extras/50d2068e45f8791e61743cc4849224d4.avif?t=1723375564\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your pond</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlock</strong> furniture and fauna to decorate your pond.<br></li><li><strong>Gather</strong> materials to be able to build specific furniture.<br></li><li><strong>Expand</strong> your pond- and build-area.<br><br>Come over and save this poor duck and their home from nosy animals and people!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "You're a duck. \ud83e\udd86 You have a pond.\ud83d\udca7 Life is great. \u2728<br>Except nosy visitors keep trying to come over to look at your pond and pet you! <br><br>Over your fallen feathers!<br><br>Territorial Duck is a cute 2D rogue-lite where you play as duck with sharing-difficulties.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/extras/ffa8f979fab75f18711a42d78f3e28da.avif?t=1723375564\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chase away visitors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Strike terror</strong> into the hearts of any who would dare step close to your pond. <br></li><li><strong>Steal items</strong> to make your quacks more fearsome to any who visit.<br></li><li><strong>Create wild builds</strong> by carefully choosing which items to steal.<br></li><li><strong>Keep your sanity</strong> until you've chased away each person and animal.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100130/extras/50d2068e45f8791e61743cc4849224d4.avif?t=1723375564\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your pond</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unlock</strong> furniture and fauna to decorate your pond.<br></li><li><strong>Gather</strong> materials to be able to build specific furniture.<br></li><li><strong>Expand</strong> your pond- and build-area.<br><br>Come over and save this poor duck and their home from nosy animals and people!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Chase away thousands of nosy animals from your pond while keeping your sanity! Then decorate your pond with flora and cute things you've shamelessly stolen. In this 2D Rogue-lite you live life as a duck getting exponentially more powerful for each item you steal.",
